``` Web scanning / probing
    MITRE ATT&CK T1595
    Data: Apache access log (access_combined_wcookie)
    Fires when a client IP generates >=20 HTTP 4xx/5xx responses.
    Validated 2026-09-30 on project_1: top 87.194.216.51 (142 errors across 12 URIs). ```
index=project_1 sourcetype=access_combined_wcookie status>=400
| stats count AS errors dc(uri_path) AS distinct_uris dc(status) AS status_codes values(method) AS methods BY clientip
| where errors >= 20
| sort - errors
